Hit the nail on the head, huh?

42
00:10:31,852 --> 00:10:38,472
いったん落ち着こう。私は大空警察に言われてここに来たの。平和に行こう！
Okay, okay, let's take a step back. Look, we don't have to fight! I'm just here because Ozora Police sent me, but we can be peaceful!

43
