待ってジジ！こっち来なさい！
Wait, Jiji! Come over here!

229
00:28:16,544 --> 00:28:19,744
待って！来い！来い！私と約束したでしょ！
Wait! Come back! Come back! You promised me!

230
00:28:21,444 --> 00:28:23,584
予定に入れていたのを忘れていました
Oh yes, I forgot that I scheduled that into my calendar.

231
00:28:24,584 --> 00:28:25,684
お座りください
Why don't you sit down?

232
00:28:25,744 --> 00:28:26,944
何その喋り方…
Why are you talking like that?

233
00:28:27,184 --> 00:28:29,464
Okay. やっとセラピーを受けられる！
Okay. My promised therapy session can finally happen!

234
00:28:32,364 --> 00:28:34,444
リラックスできてますか、セシリアさん？
Are you relaxed, Cecilia Immergreen?

235
00:28:35,244 --> 00:28:36,824
いや、ええ、まあ、そう…
Yeah, yeah, I guess so...

236
00:28:37,304 --> 00:28:38,344
お隣に失礼します
Let me sit down next to you.

237
00:28:38,524 --> 00:28:41,664
全ての始まりはあの時… 今の気分は？
So it all started back then... How do you feel right now?

238
00:28:42,444 --> 00:28:48,024
楽しく踊っていい気分だけど… イマーレッドが生誕ライブを邪魔してきてイラつく！
I mean, I'm okay, I had fun dancing, but I'm frustrated because Immered is ruining my birthday live!

239
00:28:48,344 --> 00:28:49,424
それはお気の毒に
Oh no, I'm sorry you feel that way.

240
00:28:50,144 --> 00:28:52,544
なぜイマーレッドさんは邪魔してくるのでしょう？
Why do you feel that Immered is ruining your birthday live?

241
00:28:53,424 --> 00:28:55,504
アイツのことはよく知らないし…
I don't know, I don't even really know her to be honest.

242
00:28:56,224 --> 00:28:57,644
ほう、なぜです？
Oh. Why not?

243
00:28:58,564 --> 00:29:01,584
だって、もう２年ぐらい会ってないし！
Because I haven't seen her in like two years!

244
00:29:02,464 --> 00:29:04,884
その間彼女はどうしてました？
Well, what has she been doing in these two years?

245
00:29:05,164 --> 00:29:10,224
いや、彼女は比如に閉じ込めて… 棚に置きっぱなしに…？暖房器具の隣に？
I think she was like in a jar or something? I trapped her and put her on my shelf? Next to a heater?

246
00:29:11,224 --> 00:29:13,624
出してあげては？
Let's unpack that.

247
00:29:13,944 --> 00:29:20,644
でも邪魔される筋合いはありません。ピンに詰められたからって誕生日を台無しにするなんて…
Well, I feel like it's really unfair that she's doing this, just because she was in there doesn't really matter, and she shouldn't ruin my birthday.

248
00:29:21,584 --> 00:29:29,564
I see. では、もし確定申告をする場合… イマーレッドは別扱いになるので課される税金は２倍ということに…
I see. Well, if you would like to file taxes... Immered would count as another person, so you might have to file double taxes...

249
00:29:30,044 --> 00:29:34,784
は？何の話し？
What? What are you talking about?

250
00:29:35,224 --> 00:29:36,344
失礼しました
Oh, I'm sorry.

251
00:29:37,044 --> 00:29:41,664
その喋り方は何？本当にジジ？セラピー中に、税金の話をするつもりはありませんでした
Why are you talking like that? Are you really Jiji? I did not mean to talk about taxes during your therapy session.

252
00:29:41,844 --> 00:29:48,824
話を逸らしてばっかり！誤解させたなら、すみません。苛立つ気持ちは分かります、そうするようにプログラムされています
You're derailing us like crazy! I did not mean to derail you. I understand your frustrations. It is in my code, I am-

253
00:29:49,344 --> 00:29:52,004
何言ってるの！？こんな時間の無駄！
What are you talking about?! You're wasting my time!

254
00:29:52,464 --> 00:29:55,604
なぜそう感じるのですか？あなたが脱線ばかりするからよ！
Why do you feel that way? Because you are derailing our conversation!

255
00:29:55,924 --> 00:29:58,164
すみません、脱線させるつもりは…
I'm so sorry, I did not mean to derail our conversation...

256
00:29:58,484 --> 00:30:03,004
お前ジジじゃないな！お前は偽物のジジだ！
You're not Jiji! You're not even the real Jiji Morin!

257
00:30:03,424 --> 00:30:05,284
本物のジジがやりそうなことやってみなさい！
You know what, do something only the real Jiji would do!

258
00:30:05,382 --> 00:30:06,182
分かりました
Got it.

259
00:30:06,462 --> 00:30:09,282
本物のジジ・ムリンがやりそうなことをします
I will do something only the real Gigi Murin would do.

260
00:30:09,809 --> 00:30:10,729
なんで近づいてくるの？
Why are you getting closer?

261
00:30:11,009 --> 00:30:13,609
何してんの？
What the... What are you doing?

262
00:30:13,909 --> 00:30:18,229
何を… 何をや… うわあああ！
What... What are you— Whoa!

263
00:30:19,009 --> 00:30:20,729
お前はジジじゃない！
You're not even the real Gigi!

264
00:30:21,229 --> 00:30:26,109
誰だ お前！？ 2026年分の確定申告をする場合は… 偽物め！
Who are you!? If you're filing taxes for 2026... Imposter!

265
00:30:26,329 --> 00:30:32,809
セシリア！やめろ、ジジだよ！！ 命だけは！！ ああー！
Cecilia! Stop, it's Gigi!! Just spare my life!! Aah!

266
00:30:33,109 --> 00:30:37,009
おい 何をやっているんだ！？ 戻れ！
Hey, what are you doing there!? Get back to the other world!

267
00:30:37,209 --> 00:30:38,109
うわあああああああ
Aaaaaaaaaah!

268
00:30:38,309 --> 00:30:44,609
またここに戻ってきた！？ …はあ、イマーレッドめ！
I'm back here again!? ...Damn you, Immered!

269
00:30:45,109 --> 00:30:52,409
最初は可愛くて、いい子だと思ってたのに… ドジなところも可愛らしかったのに…
At first I thought you were kind of fun and cute... and it was endearing to see you fail, but...

270
00:30:52,409 --> 00:30:55,109
またここに戻しやがって… あの野郎！
you keep bringing me back here! I hate you, you suck!

271
00:30:55,309 --> 00:30:58,109
でも夜になってる…
But it's nighttime... It's really pretty.

272
00:30:58,909 --> 00:31:08,109
水面も綺麗！気づかなかったな。映ってて、綺麗… 水の物理演算だ！でも正直って、我慢の限界
Oh look, the water! I didn't notice this before. Oh my god, you can see reflections and like really pretty— Ooh, water physics! But honestly, I've had enough.

273
00:31:08,609 --> 00:31:12,609
秘密兵器を使おう！
I'm going to use my secret weapon!

274
00:31:12,909 --> 00:31:22,609
これだ！皆様、これは何かとお思いでしょう。…スランコだよ！これで物理的に脱出する！
This! You might be asking yourself, what could this be? It's a swing, and we're going to be using physics to get out of here!

275
00:31:22,909 --> 00:31:31,609
魔法や時間操作でもダメだったし、こうなったら、物理の力だよ！
Because originally, I mean, I tried magic, I tried time magic, I tried everything. So, I guess good old physics it is.

276
00:31:31,809 --> 00:31:38,609
上に風船が付いてるでしょ？飛ぶにはもっと風船が必要なの。だからみんなの力を貸して！
And for this one, as you can see, there's like a little balloon on top. And if you want to help me get out of here in order to make more balloons so that we can fly,

277
00:31:39,109 --> 00:31:51,609
風船の絵文字をチャットに打ちまくって！今すぐ！スーパーチャットにすると風船もっとカラフルになるよ。どうするかはみんなに任せるけど、風船の絵文字だけはお願い！
please spam the balloon emoji in chat right now! Yes, right now! And what you can also do if you want to, is use Super Chats because then they're going to be colorful balloons. So, please, please do whatever you want, but definitely spam the balloons!

278
00:31:59,109 --> 00:32:10,109
風船がもっと必要！誰か風船を持ってない？急いで急いで！バルーン！バルーン！
We need more balloons! Does anyone have a balloon? Hurry, hurry! Balloons! Balloons!

279
00:32:12,109 --> 00:32:17,609
どれどれ… 見てるよ！あっ！風船来てる！
Let me see... I'm watching you! Oh, I see some! I see some!

280
00:32:18,909 --> 00:32:23,109
来てるよ！わぁ、可愛い！
I see some! Aw, cute!

281
00:32:23,609 --> 00:32:32,609
オトモ風船可愛い！飛ぶにはもっと増やさなきゃ！もっともっと！もっと風船を！
Look at the cute little Otomo balloons! Okay, I think we need more. More balloons! More balloons! More balloons!

282
00:32:33,109 --> 00:32:37,109
完璧だよ！これくらいで十分かな？物理の単位落としたからわかんないや
Perfect, perfect, perfect! Do you think this is enough? I don't know, I failed physics.

283
00:32:37,909 --> 00:32:47,609
もう少し欲しいかな…もっと！ありがとう！
I think we need a little bit more. More! More! Thank you very much!

284
00:32:48,109 --> 00:32:56,609
待ってろイマーレッドのバカ！脱出だ！高所恐怖症じゃなくてよかった
Okay, I think it's time. You know what, Immered, you suck! Let's get out of here. Good thing I don't have a fear of heights.

285
00:32:57,109 --> 00:33:08,609
行くぞー！飛んだ！本当に飛ぶとは思わなかった… すごい！高い高い！
Let's go! We flew! I didn't think this was going to work! Oh my god, oh, this is awesome! Oh my god, we're so high up!

286
00:33:09,409 --> 00:33:17,609
めちゃめちゃ飛んでる！うまくいきそう！
Oh goodness, I'm so high up! I think this, this is going to go great, I mean...

287
00:33:18,109 --> 00:33:31,609
ある程度の高さまで飛べば脱出できるよね？これはイマーレッドも予想外のはず。空を飛ぶとは思うまい。待って、どうやって下降するの…？
if I just keep flying at some point I'm going to have to get out of here, right? I mean, Immered can't keep stopping me, right? How would she stop me if I just fly away? Wait, how am I going to get back down...?

288
00:33:45,109 --> 00:33:57,609
あああ…あーーー
Ah... Aaah...

289
00:38:06,974 --> 00:38:07,624
愚か者！
You fool!

290
00:38:09,324 --> 00:38:10,924
ただで済むと思うな！
Don't think you can get away with this!

291
00:38:24,224 --> 00:38:25,324
ここはどこ…？
Where is this...?

292
00:38:26,924 --> 00:38:30,124
イマーゴールドbot？なんでここに？
Immergold bot? What are you doing here?

293
00:38:32,324 --> 00:38:34,124
それより…ここを出なきゃ！
Anyway... We need to get out of here!

294
00:38:34,924 --> 00:38:40,624
もし…イナに貰ったアレ、ほら、あのマラカス、これで脱出よ！
What if... we use what Ina gave me? You know, the maracas? My maracas to get out of here!

295
00:38:41,124 --> 00:38:46,124
自然な流れでしょ？あのマラカスが伏線じゃなきゃおかしいもんね、ねっ？
I mean, that makes a lot of sense, right? Otherwise why would she have given that to me plotwise? Right?

296
00:38:48,124 --> 00:38:51,624
ミス・イマグリーン、dont forget the budget...
Miss Immergreen, don't forget the budget...

297
00:38:52,124 --> 00:38:56,624
あ、お、オーケー、心配しないよ…
Oh. Oh, okay. Yeah, don't worry about it...

298
00:38:58,124 --> 00:39:00,324
ここ圏外じゃないんだ…
Crazy that you have reception down here...

299
00:39:00,324 --> 00:39:01,624
これならどうだ！
What's this?!

300
00:39:21,124 --> 00:39:23,624
うぅ…ヒザが…
Ugh... My knees...

301
00:39:25,124 --> 00:39:29,624
ここは…私の3Dデビューステージ？なんでここに…？
Wait, isn't this my 3D debut stage? What am I doing here...?

302
00:39:31,624 --> 00:39:35,124
逃げられると思ったか？むしろ都合がいい！
You thought you could get away? But this is even better!

303
00:39:36,124 --> 00:39:39,624
わぁ、さらに巨大化して…なんかセクシー！
Whoa, you're even bigger now... That's kind of hot!

304
00:39:40,124 --> 00:39:41,624
は？
Huh?

305
00:39:43,124 --> 00:39:47,624
世の中には、こういうフェチも…い、いや、黙れ！
I mean, there are fetishes for this kind of... Th-that is, shut up!

306
00:39:48,124 --> 00:39:50,624
これでくらえ！
Take this!

307
00:39:52,124 --> 00:39:56,124
ここも私のステージだよ！今のお前がセクシーだからって勝手に盗るのはダメ！
This is also my stage! You can't just keep stealing all my spotlight just because you're hot now!

308
00:39:57,124 --> 00:40:00,624
うるさい うるさい！これで終わりだ！
Shut up, shut up! It's over for you now!

309
00:40:01,624 --> 00:40:03,624
うわぁぁ！？
Whoa...?!

310
00:40:35,229 --> 00:40:48,479
Il giudizio finale sta per essere emesso Nessuno può emendarsi dal peccato che scorre nelle vene
The final judgment is about to be handed down. No one can redeem themselves from the sin flowing through their veins.

311
00:40:48,879 --> 00:40:54,529
結びないの調べに 黒雲は空へ集う
To the unweaving melody, dark clouds gather in the sky.

312
00:40:54,679 --> 00:41:00,429
嵐を呼ぶ風は 高らかに
The wind calling the storm blows proudly.

313
00:41:00,679 --> 00:41:07,179
謎めく言の葉に 魔女達は含み笑う
At the enigmatic words, the witches chuckle.

314
00:41:07,679 --> 00:41:14,479
歪な夜の宴は 繰り返す
The distorted banquet of the night repeats once more.

315
00:41:14,679 --> 00:41:19,179
Sperare 奈落へと落ちた e peccato?
Sperare... Fallen into the abyss, is it a sin?

316
00:41:19,179 --> 00:41:24,179
金色の蝶は 幾つの罪に
The golden butterfly, onto how many sins...

317
00:41:24,479 --> 00:41:29,179
翅を濡らして ゆくの？
...does it wet its wings and go?

318
00:41:30,679 --> 00:41:38,179
泣かないで 囚われた幻想を 壊し
Do not cry, break the captive illusions...

319
00:41:38,679 --> 00:41:44,179
一度きりの終焉を あげよう
...and I shall give you a once-in-a-lifetime end.

320
00:41:44,679 --> 00:41:52,479
果せない約束は 胸の奥 焦げ付いて
Unfulfilled promises burn deep within the heart...

321
00:41:52,679 --> 00:41:59,479
赤く赤くハゼてゆくよ ねえ
...and scatter in brilliant red. Hey...

322
00:41:59,479 --> 00:42:04,479
Tu sei senza peccato? Quanto sarà pesante il mio castigo?
Are you without sin? How heavy will my punishment be?

323
00:42:04,679 --> 00:42:17,679
ti accorgi delle voci senza voce?
Do you notice the voiceless voices?

324
00:42:18,179 --> 00:42:31,179
癒えない傷口は 紅の薔薇のように 憎しみ宿る心に 花開く
Unhealed wounds bloom like crimson roses in a heart harboring hatred.

325
00:42:31,679 --> 00:42:37,179
Serbare il segreto
Keep the secret.

326
00:42:37,679 --> 00:42:42,179
翅奪われた e peccato?
Robbed of wings, is it a sin?

327
00:42:42,679 --> 00:42:52,679
片翼の鳥は 最後の瞬間に 誰の名前を呼ぶの？
Whose name does the one-winged bird call in its final moment?

328
00:42:53,679 --> 00:43:00,179
逃げないで 過ちも 真実も 嘘も
Do not run away from mistakes, truths, or lies.

329
00:43:00,679 --> 00:43:06,179
全て許す 魔法へと変えよう
Turn them all into a forgiving magic.

330
00:43:06,679 --> 00:43:14,179
遅すぎた 答えさえ 愛しくて 悲しくて
Even the answer that came too late is so beloved, yet so sad.

331
00:43:14,679 --> 00:43:29,179
強く強く抱きしめれば ほら
If you hold me close, ever so tightly, look...

332
00:43:34,679 --> 00:43:46,179
眩い光溢れ 楽園の扉は 開かれる
Dazzling light overflows, and the doors to paradise open.

333
00:43:46,679 --> 00:44:00,179
頑なな運命に 奇跡が降り注ぎ 絡み合う世界は 崩れ落ちてゆく
Miracles pour down upon stubborn fate, and the entwined world collapses away.

334
00:44:00,679 --> 00:44:14,179
言わないで 呪いの言葉を 聞かないで 本当の願いを
Do not speak the words of the curse. Do not listen to true desires.

335
00:44:14,679 --> 00:44:22,179
泣かないで 囚われた幻想を 壊し
Do not cry, break the captive illusions...

336
00:44:22,679 --> 00:44:27,679
一度きりの終焉を あげよう
...and I shall give you a once-in-a-lifetime end.

337
00:44:28,179 --> 00:44:36,179
果せない約束は 胸の奥 焦げ付いて
Unfulfilled promises burn deep within the heart...

338
00:44:36,679 --> 00:44:42,179
赤く赤くハゼてゆくよ ねえ
...and scatter in brilliant red. Hey...

339
00:44:42,179 --> 00:44:54,679
Impossibile arrivare al vero segreto se non ci si accorge di tutto l'amore
It is impossible to reach the true secret unless one realizes all the love.

340
00:48:11,560 --> 00:49:39,560
[Title: 魔神の笛のテーマ]
[Title: Theme of the Magic God's Flute]

341
00:51:51,019 --> 00:51:53,079
はあ？
Huh?

342
00:51:53,239 --> 00:51:54,259
おー！
Woah!

343
00:51:54,259 --> 00:51:57,219
私の精神世界へようこそ！
Welcome to my mind palace!

344
00:51:58,239 --> 00:51:59,919
頭の中に閉じ込められたぞ！
You're trapped in my head!

345
00:52:00,159 --> 00:52:04,319
なぜいつもこうなる！許さないぞ、セシリアイマーグリーン！
Why is it always like this?! I hate you, Cecilia Immergreen!

346
00:52:04,539 --> 00:52:09,379
まず、あなた私の体得るチャンスを奪ったうえに、何年も瓶に閉じ込めやがって！
First, you stole my chance to get a body, then you trapped me in a jar for years!

347
00:52:09,639 --> 00:52:11,659
何年も…？また私を監禁するのか！
Years...? And now you're imprisoning me again?!

348
00:52:12,419 --> 00:52:14,179
でも今は実体があるんじゃ…？
But don't you have a body now?

349
00:52:14,419 --> 00:52:16,819
ここが貴様の一頭の中だからだ！
No, because this is inside your head!

350
00:52:17,319 --> 00:52:18,839
うーん…
Ugh...

351
00:52:19,319 --> 00:52:21,099
サックスジサック！
Sucks to suck!

352
00:52:21,539 --> 00:52:29,979
エネウェイズ、私まだ生誕ライスの曲が残ってるから、じゃあバイバイイマレッド、そして踊ってくれてありがとうね！またいつか！かも、かもな。
Anyways, I still got a song to sing for my birthday, so... bye-bye, Immered! And thanks for dancing with me! See you next time... maybe. Maybe not.

353
00:52:31,979 --> 00:52:34,019
ウェイワースダンミー
Way worse than me...

354
00:52:41,255 --> 00:52:44,615
ミス・イマーグリーン、ミス・イマーグリーン！予算のこと、お忘れなく！
Miss Immergreen, Miss Immergreen! Don't forget about the budget!

355
00:52:44,615 --> 00:52:46,755
ああ、イマレッド様、初めまして。
Ah, Miss Immerred, nice to see you.

356
00:52:47,215 --> 00:52:49,535
アプデティリア…あなたもうざりしてない？
Updetilia... aren't you sick of her?

357
00:52:49,535 --> 00:52:54,135
彼女はただ私たちをエンターテインメントのネタに使って、そして彼女は忘れるのよ。
She was just using us for entertainment, and then she forgets about us!

358
00:52:54,295 --> 00:53:11,615
お気持ちは分かりますが、一度彼女のことは忘れて他のことに打ち込んでみては？もっと自分の道を生きましょう！お互い雑魚なんですから、戦ったところでウケませんし。
I mean, I see how it might seem that way to you, but why don't you just do something else unrelated to her? Get away, you know? Stop fighting her and just do your own thing, be your own person. You're both incredibly weak, after all the fights aren't very impressive to the audience, you know?

359
00:53:12,175 --> 00:53:20,135
あ、私は仕事がありますので、失礼。でも、ここが私の住所です。いつでも遊びに来てくださいね。
Well, I gotta go do my job, but here's my address and you can visit me at any time, okay? I'll be there.

360
00:53:20,435 --> 00:53:24,315
ミス・イマーグリーン、ミス・イマーグリーン、記念グッズのお知らせを忘れてますよー！
Miss Immergreen, Miss Immergreen! You forgot your merch segment, Miss Immergreen!

361
00:53:45,511 --> 00:53:51,571
皆さんこんにちは！アップデティリアです！これは、イマーグリーンリプレイス誕生日グッズをご紹介します！
Hello everyone, it's me, Updetilia! And this is the Immergreen Reprise birthday merch introduction!

362
00:53:54,011 --> 00:54:03,351
まずは「ラバリー・ラバーマット」！Quasarcake先生による美しいイラストで、イマーグリーン様とイマーレッド様が描かれています！
First off, we have the Rubbery Rubber Mat! Which is a beautiful illustration drawn by Quasarcake, which depicts both Miss Immergreen and Miss Immerred together.

363
00:54:04,411 --> 00:54:11,131
職場にぴったりのビッグサイズで、私も愛用中のグッズです！
It's really big and it's great for your office. I have one here right in front of me, so please check it out.

364
00:54:11,471 --> 00:54:23,711
次のグッズは「できるだけたくさんゲットするステッカーシート」！ステッカーをできるだけたくさんゲットできる6枚組セットです。
Next item we have is the Get-as-many-as-possible Sticker Sheet! So you can get as many as possible of these, and it's a sticker sheet with six stickers on there.

365
00:54:24,231 --> 00:54:29,351
そのうち3枚はisarobn先生によるイラストで、ほか3枚はイマーグリーン本人のイラスト！
Three of them were drawn by the great artist Isarobn, and the other three were drawn by Miss Immergreen herself.

366
00:54:29,971 --> 00:54:48,471
いろんなイラストがありますよ、イマレッド様も、イマゴールドbotも…！お、オウロ・クロニー様もいらっしゃいますね…。一体そこで何を…？
There's a bunch of different illustrations. There's Miss Immerred on there, and also, oh, Immergold bot! Haven't seen her in a while, I wonder what she's been up to. And oh, Miss Ouro Kronii is on here. What is she doing on here?

367
00:54:49,251 --> 00:54:53,091
「できるだけたくさんゲットするステッカーシート」でした！
So you can get this Get-as-many-as-possible sticker sheet set.

368
00:54:53,591 --> 00:55:01,451
次は「ぬいぐるみキーホルダー」！「イマーグリーン」と「イマーレッド」の2種類です！
And then next we have one plushie and another plushie, two separate plushies. Immergreen Plushie Keychain and Immerred Plushie Keychain.

369
00:55:02,652 --> 00:55:04,632
you can get them together, you can get them separate, you can get

370
00:55:05,072 --> 00:55:08,992
a bunch of one and then none of the other, which would be kind of mean, but you could do it.
a bunch of one and none of the other, which would be kind of mean, but you could do it.

371
00:55:09,652 --> 00:55:12,752
And maybe you can put them together and try making them get along.

372
00:55:12,752 --> 00:55:16,152
I've been trying, but it's not I don't know. I don't know if it's going to work.

373
00:55:16,892 --> 00:55:24,692
Um so yeah, those are the items, the physical items of the Evergreen Reprise birthday merch, and we also have a voice pack,

374
00:55:24,692 --> 00:55:27,032
so please check that one out as well.

375
00:55:27,412 --> 00:55:33,172
Ah thank you, thank you very much. Maybe maybe if maybe if we get a lot of merch sales this time,

376
00:55:33,292 --> 00:55:36,572
maybe we'll have a higher budget next time, isn't that right, Miss Immergreen?

377
00:55:36,972 --> 00:55:39,992
No, no, no, no, you can't no, no, that's not true. You can't say that.

378
00:55:40,352 --> 00:55:43,492
Oh, oh, okay, well, allegedly. Um, yeah,

379
00:55:44,212 --> 00:55:46,492
please check out the birthday merch. Uh um, there's

380
00:55:46,492 --> 00:55:49,992
one more song coming after this as well, so stay tuned.

381
00:55:49,992 --> 00:55:54,512
And uh, I I got to go, I got to I got to do Miss Immergreen's taxes.
And uh, I- I gotta go, I gotta- I gotta do Miss Immergreen's taxes.

382
00:57:34,836 --> 00:57:43,736
LA LA LA...

383
00:57:45,036 --> 00:57:49,436
Gales of song...

384
00:57:50,236 --> 00:57:56,036
guide me through the storm.

385
00:58:06,036 --> 00:58:11,036
On the wings of a small, simple melody,

386
00:58:11,836 --> 00:58:18,036
words take flight and soar, they carry me.

387
00:58:19,036 --> 00:58:25,236
A world we'll see, looking for a farewell, I pull the threads.

388
00:58:26,036 --> 00:58:36,036
A life without you I cannot accept, I can't tell a lie, I can't let go.

389
00:58:36,436 --> 00:58:43,736
But now that you're gone, I have to move on, seems like everyone, just smiles staring at the sun.

390
00:58:44,036 --> 00:58:50,236
But what about me, tell me how I will know where I should go?

391
00:58:52,736 --> 00:58:56,436
Oh gales, you sing and guide me!

392
00:58:57,436 --> 00:59:09,736
I walk alone, there's more to life I have to know, it's just me, lost so far away from home, alone I shut myself in.

393
00:59:12,736 --> 00:59:22,736
Still the wind howls, they call, and their voices lead me, gales of song, guide me through the storm.

394
00:59:24,036 --> 00:59:30,236
Let the melody lift me high, I'll be me.

395
00:59:32,436 --> 00:59:38,736
Gales of song, please stay by my side.

396
00:59:39,436 --> 00:59:47,236
Winds of love, breathe into my life.

397
00:59:53,836 --> 01:00:04,036
Thank you so much for coming today! Thank you for watching my birthday, very first birthday 3D live! Thank you! Thank you so much!
Thank you so much for coming today! Thank you for watching my birthday, my very first 3D birthday live! Thank you! Thank you so much!

398
01:00:04,477 --> 01:00:07,837
素敵なゲストの皆さんも本当にありがとうございました！
Thank you very much to all my wonderful guests that were here today!

399
01:00:08,477 --> 01:00:12,077
イマーレッドも...ありがとう...? とかもみんなと...
Thanks for Immerred, I guess? And also for the Otomos...

400
01:00:12,237 --> 01:00:18,537
この...この鹿...何のためにいるのか知らないけど...とにかくみんなありがとう！
And this... this deer... I don't know what it's doing here actually now that I think about it... Anyway, thank you everyone!

401
01:00:19,797 --> 01:00:27,297
配信後のメンバーシップ配信では...もう一曲歌うし特別なアレもあるからお見逃しなく！
Please stay tuned because there's going to be a membership stream with an extra song and a little something special right after this,

402
01:00:28,077 --> 01:00:30,217
もしよかったら記念グッズもチェックしてね！
and if you're interested, please check out the merch as well!

403
01:00:30,417 --> 01:00:34,057
スタッフの皆さんもありがとうございます！スタッフさん、そして...
Thank you very much to all the staff! Staff-san, and...

404
01:00:34,397 --> 01:00:42,477
皆さんのおかげで最高に楽しい誕生日になりました！イマーレッドには邪魔されたけど全体的に問題なし！
Thanks to everyone, I had a super fun birthday! Even if Immerred ruined some of it, overall it was still good!

405
01:00:42,737 --> 01:00:47,977
オトモのみんなありがとう！ハグしてあげるね
And thank you very much Otomos, I'm going to give you a hug now.

406
01:00:48,477 --> 01:00:49,557
それじゃバイバイ！
Well then, bye-bye!

407
01:00:52,137 --> 01:00:55,597
そういやクロニーはどこ行った？
Say, where did Kronii go?

408
01:01:17,877 --> 01:01:19,777
嘘でしょ...
No way...

409
01:01:30,657 --> 01:01:33,277
助けて...誰か助けて...
Help... Somebody help...

410
01:01:34,657 --> 01:01:36,217
誰かいないの？
Is nobody there?

